{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00674","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 和宁舞 · 牛僧孺","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 和宁舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湜湜颀颀，融昭德辉。\n不纽不舒，贯成九围。\n武烈文经，敷施当宜。\n纂尧付啓，亿万熙熙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛僧孺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00674.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00674","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}